Subject: Re: scale_fill_manual to create a custom legend : appears to do nothing.
Message-ID: <YfgemhNoAZ4.ZkSSraih4uIJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <YfgemhNoAZ4.wZBKce4_8mMJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
